    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver spirits to their final rest.\u00a0Command a spectral train as a Reaper in <i>Ghost Engine</i>, a chilling tower defense game steeped in eerie retro visuals and haunting classical music. Strategically place towers with melee attack or magical abilities such as stun or fire, to battle waves of zombies, possessed armors, and ghosts. Adapt to shifting enemy patterns with clever tactics to survive the relentless spectral onslaught!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver spirits to their final rest.\u00a0Command a spectral train as a Reaper in <i>Ghost Engine</i>, a chilling tower defense game steeped in eerie retro visuals and haunting classical music. Strategically place towers with melee attack or magical abilities such as stun or fire, to battle waves of zombies, possessed armors, and ghosts. Adapt to shifting enemy patterns with clever tactics to survive the relentless spectral onslaught!</p>",
    "short_description": "A horror-themed tower defense game where you strategically place towers with special abilities to battle monsters and spirits. Adapt and outsmart relentless enemy waves with clever tactics in this retro-styled challenge.",
